window.products.push({"id":232083,"name":"Magisso Teacup, Pure Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810MKN9QOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Magisso Teacup makes drinking tea even more simple and relaxing than ever before. Just tilt the teacup so that the strainer side is lower. Put tea leaves into strainer, pour hot water on the leaves, and let steep for desired time. Tilt the teacup the other way and the tea is ready to be enjoyed. This cup is the perfect alternative to both tea bags and infusers. You get the security of a teabag with the ecofriend, richness of your favorite loose leaf tea no matter how fine. The filtration system uses very fine holes to allow only water into the cup, holding on to your tea leaves and preventing you from drinking tea with leaf debris. This design allows you to get a sleek, and modern looking teacup with the classic quality you trust from Magisso and Teacup. Thanks to the triangle bottom, it is easy to adjust the strength of tea depending on your taste without making a mess. Its reliable structure allows you to tilt as desired without the worry of teetering back for a consistent cup of tea. The convenience of this cup doesn’t just end when the tea runs out. Once you’re finished your perfect cup of tea, the filter pops right out for easy cleaning. Dispose of your leaves and put the cup in the dishwasher or hand wash as desired. Now you’re ready for your next delicious cup of tea. Package contains (1) Magisso Teacup. Teacup with removable mess free filter. BPA free. Made from SAN (thermo resistant food grade plastic) and features a glossy interior and matte exterior. Dishwasher safe. Not microwave safe. Designed in Finland for Magisso by Laura Bougdanos and Vesa Jaasko. Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810MKN9QOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magisso","source_asin":"B01MY78P8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MY78P8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MY78P8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
