window.products.push({"id":232240,"name":"AYOTEE Silicone Butter Molds with Butter Spreader Knife, Butter Mold with Lid Storage Jar Silicon Butter Mold Tray, Large 4 Cavities Rectangle Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Za1R3R3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fresh-keeping Lid Design】AYOTEE airtight butter dish with lid and knife. The lid can be easily snapped down and tightly closed, and the lid has a sealing performance of 90%. It can effectively prevent the mess caused by overflow in the refrigerator, effectively block the odor in the refrigerator and keep the food fresh. The extra large butter dish come with a ceramic handle Butter Spreader Knife. Don't worry about not having a butter knife when you want to cut butter. 【Hard Frame Design】The large ice cube mold is equipped with a full silicone base,which does not collapse and is not easily deformed when filling.Different from other soft all-silicon butter stick molds with covers,the PP material hard frame design of AYOTEE silicone butter holder for refrigerator which can make it easier for people to move the tray.The stick butter container will not be soft and deformed in case of high temperature,which can effectively prevent spilling and other problems. 【Large Butter Dish with Lid】AYOTEE silicone butter tray with lid measures 11.6\"x6.7\"x2.5\" and each cavities size is 5.5\"x1.8\"x1.8\", which is wide and deep enough to hold 4 OZ Standard sticks of butter. Each compartment has four fill lines: ½ cup, 1 cup, 125 mL, 250 mL, making portioning simple. Note: please be careful not to exceed the scale of the highest water level when filling. Otherwise, the liquid will easily overflow and solidify together, making it difficult to demold. 【Multi-functional Silicone Freezing Trays with Lid】Good for storing and making 4 OZ butter sticks, it can also make different kinds of butter bars. It also can be used as silicone ice cube trays baby food, silicone soup freezer molds, extra large ice cube molds or more. The silicon ice cube molds is easy to release. Recommend wait for 3-4 mins after leaving the refrigerator or run the bottom of the mold with warm water 30s that will easier to pop out the ice cube/butter stick. 【Premium Materials & Stackable Design】AYOTEE butter silicone mold is made with high quality food-grade platinum silicone, which is safe for home and daily use. Free from BPA and resistant to 120°C. It can be used in microwave ovens and dishwashers. Temperature range: - 4°F to 248°F (-20℃ to 120℃). Note: The airtight lid is made of PP, it is not suitable for extended heating. Moreover, the butter dishes with covers can be piled to save freezer space. Place it horizontally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Za1R3R3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYOTEE","source_asin":"B09TVJVDM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVJVDM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVJVDM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
