window.products.push({"id":232331,"name":"Thermee Micro Flannel Twin-Size Sheet Set, Machine Wash & Dry, No Pilling, Deep Pocket with Pillowcase(s), Birches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U9OR8b-zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Shavel Home Products Thermee Micro Flannel sheet set is an innovative new fabrication with unique features and benefits. This patent pending construction has an amazingly soft and luxurious feel. It offers warmth, without the weight of bulky fleece sheet sets. The Shavel Home Products Thermee Micro Flannel sheet set does not shrink or pill, it is wrinkle resistant and fits your bed like a glove. Thermee Micro Flannel envelopes you in a soft and cozy comfort that keeps your body at a consistent temperature! it creates a wonderful ambient cocoon for a perfect sleeping environment. The Shavel Home ProductsThermee Micro Flannel sheet sets are easy care, with quick wash and quick dry benefit that can save you money on your energy bills. Twin sheet includes: 39 inch W x 75 inch L x 12 inch d fitted sheet 66 inch W x 96 inch L flat sheet 21 inch W x 32 inch L pillowcase twin XL sheet set includes: 39 inch W x 81 inch L x 12 inch d fitted sheet 66 inch W x 96 inch L flat sheet 21 inch W x 31 inch L pillowcase full sheet set includes: 54 inch W x 75 inch L x 14 inch d fitted sheet 86 inch W x 100 inch L flat sheet two 21 inch W x 32 inch L pillowcases Queen sheet set includes: 60 inch W x 80 inch L x 16 inch d fitted sheet 92 inch W x 108 inch L flat sheet two 21 inch W x 32 inch L pillowcases King sheet set includes: 78 inch W x 80 inch L x 16 inch d fitted sheet set 110 inch W x 108 inch L flat sheet two 21 inch W x 40 inch L King pillowcases California King sheet set includes 72 inch W x 84 inch L x 16 inch d fitted sheet 110 W x 108 inch d flat sheet two 21 inch W x 40 inch L King pillowcases. Thermee and Micro flannel are registered trademarks of Shavel Home Products/Patent pending.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U9OR8b-zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thermee Micro Flannel","source_asin":"B07VZKFYHV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VZKFYHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VZKFYHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":232332,"name":"CUDDLE DREAMS Premium Cashmere Throw Blanket with Fringe, Luxuriously Soft (Bamboo Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h57WUA9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cuddle Dreams focuses on exclusive products with natural materials to deliver premium quality and exceptional comfort. Our factory has more than 20 years experience in authentic cashmere products, located in Inner Mongolia.   This fringed cashmere throw blanket embodies simple luxury.  To achieve its supreme warmth and remarkable durability, we blend fine merino wool (25%) with premium cashmere (75%) from Inner Mongolia, which is widely recognized as one of the finest cashmere origins in the world. To withstand the country's extremely cold climate, cashmere goats have an undercoat of fine down. This down is combed out in spring, and unwanted long hairs would be separated out. Each goat may only produce 3 to 4 ounces of cashmere. You can see why cashmere is so treasured. Nothing compares to cashmere for luxury, softness and warmth.  It is perfect to keep you cozy during movie marathons, or while reading your favorite book or taking a nap, you’ll never have a cozier time curled up on the couch. Wrap yourself in luxury and warmth all year round with our finely crafted cashmere throw blanket.   Dry Clean Only.  Friendly reminder:  -Please be understood the potential color difference between pictures and actual product due to different screen display or ambient light. -Pillings aren't a sign of cheap cashmere but the result of ordinary friction. Comb them out with a boar-bristle brush, mow them down with a battery-powered sweater shaver. With great care, this incredibly soft blanket will stay in style and give you comfort for many years!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h57WUA9YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUDDLE DREAMS","source_asin":"B075CYG58Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075CYG58Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075CYG58Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
