window.products.push({"id":232336,"name":"Cybrtrayd Life of the Party K093 Princess Pretzel Pop Thrones Chocolate Candy Mold in Sealed Protective Poly Bag Imprinted with Copyrighted Cybrtrayd ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wS9P1Qd1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wS9P1Qd1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPKA2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPKA2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPKA2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":232337,"name":"Silicone Ice Cube Tray with lid,3D Rose Ice Molds, 4-chamber Silicone Rose Ice Hockey Machine, Large Novelty Rose Ice Mold Whiskey Cocktail, Refrigera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61frplAVEqL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"🍷4 large slowly melting rose ice cubes: Rose ice cubes molds can make 4 large rose ice balls at a time. Each rose ice is 2.4 inches in diameter. Long-lasting rose ice keeps your drinks cool longer, perfect for cocktails, iced coffee, iced tea, juice, whiskey and bourbon. 🍷 Leakproof, easy release: Upgrade the connecting edge groove between the bottom and the cover to effectively prevent water overflow. The ball of roses shape has a small funnel to fill each rose part and place in the fridge for 5-6 hours. Once frozen, it's easy to take the ice out. 🍷FOOD-PREMIUM Safety Materials :4 sets of ice trays, safe and durable. Can be used in refrigerators, microwaves and dishwashers. Bring the perfect cocktail and iced coffee experience to customers at home. The silicone ice Cube tray kit is great for family use, parties and bars, offices, holiday events and holiday gifts. 🍷 Extend the chill time of drinks: Avoid drinks with water, and use these large, slow-melting rose ice cubes to chill drinks. The large ice cubes will slowly melt, preventing dilution of the drink, and the ice cubes will keep long enough to be topped with another drink 🍷 Stylish appearance and funky colors: green, black design to provide you with a more enjoyable ice making experience. If you have any questions about our ice trays, please contact us. We pay attention to every detail to ensure that our products meet your expectations. Your opinion is of great value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61frplAVEqL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coldcool","source_asin":"B09W24N66Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W24N66Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W24N66Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
