window.products.push({"id":232395,"name":"WPM Bathroom Rugs and Shower Curtain Set. Royal Blue Trellis Print Luxury Absorbent Bath Rug Contour mat, Non Slip Plush Carpet for Floor. Fabric Show","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sUlVxlKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGN: This complete matching bathroom accessories set adds charm and style to your bathroom. Comes with luxurious soft and fluffy microfiber bath rug and Contour mat. The printed shower curtain is rich in colors and vivid, Not easy to fade and is water repellent to let water glide off and quick to dry. Also comes with decorative towels and roller hooks. Creative and unique patterns instantly refresh and warm your bathroom. MATERIAL: Bathroom Rugs- Bath rugs are made of ultra heavy density microfiber and are constructed of 1.18 inches height premium thick and soft fluffy microfiber, thicker and well constructed than most other brands. These Plush bath rugs are great for any bathroom, vacation home, kids bathroom, guest suite. Soft high pile microfiber helps from dripping water while stepping out of the bath, shower, or by the sink. Moisture is absorbed in piles allowing the rug to dry quickly. Shower curtain- Made from 100% Polyester fabric are water repellent to let water glide off and quick to dry Hooks- 12 rust resistant metal shower hooks set Towels- comes with 3 microfiber decorative towel set NON SKID TPR BACKING: Bathroom mats are made of more expensive TP Rubber backing (not PVC or glue) which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use. Note: Do not place mat on wet surface to prevent the rug from slipping. Size: Bath rug is 20 inch x 32 inch in size, contour mat is 20 inch x 20 inch Shower curtain size is 71 inch x 71 inch Towels- 3 towels size- 12inch x 12inch, 12inch x 24 inch, 24 inch x 48 inch CARE: Bathroom mats, shower curtain and towels are easy to clean easy care. Machine wash separately with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) tumble dry at low speed or hang dry. USE: This complete set has multi-purpose use. Matching design set lends a beautiful rich decor element to your bathroom, bring charming and great feeling for your family. Good for any size bathroom; Rugs can be places in front of your single or double sink, shower, bathtub. Matching shower curtain can also be use as window curtains in your other room windows. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sUlVxlKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WPM WORLD PRODUCTS MART","source_asin":"B0BD2NHTCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD2NHTCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD2NHTCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
