window.products.push({"id":232420,"name":"Space Heater, Portable Heater, Adjustable Thermostat, Tip-Over & Overheat Protection, Carrying Handle, Dust Panel Design, Office, Home, Garage(Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w4deOEHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Space heaters bring you warmth in winter. The heater adopts a heat generator with high thermal efficiency and stability, and uses a fan to achieve convection circulation, which can quickly transfer the heat generated by the heater to the room, thus achieving the ideal heating purpose. It has a high degree of safety and is suitable for homes, offices and other environments. Features of the portable space heater. 🎉 Stable performance, Fast heating, Uniform heat dissipation 🎉 Low consumption, Long service life, Good insulation performance 🎉 High temperature resistance 🎉 Safety and security Please note. (1) This product is only suitable for indoor use, please do not use it outdoors. (2) Please turn off the power before pulling out the plug. Please do not touch the power supply with wet hands, otherwise there is a risk of electric shock. (3) Do not touch the surface of the heater after turning it on to avoid burns. Especially for children, do not let them near the heater. (4) This product should not be placed next to the curtains of other indoor furniture. It should be placed more than 1 meter away from walls and furniture. There should be no coverings within 1 meter of the top to promote air circulation. (5) Do not use or store it in a damp or dusty place for a long time to avoid moisture corrosion of the housing, leakage or electric shock. (6) When leaving or not in use for a long time, be sure to pull the power plug from the socket. (7) Do not use this heater around bathtubs, jets or swimming pools. (8) The heater should not be placed directly under the outlet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w4deOEHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALYWOOD","source_asin":"B09CM8Q8G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CM8Q8G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CM8Q8G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
