window.products.push({"id":232453,"name":"Atelier Bedding 100% Cotton Fitted Sheet 400 Thread Count 15\" Deep Pockets Soft & Silky Cool Luxury Percale Weave for Home & Hotel(King, Ivory Cream)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519FeIaHTOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PURE QUALITY 100% COTTON FITTED SHEETS: Are you looking for super soft fitted sheets? You are at the right place. These fitted sheets are made of 100% natural cotton in percale weave. These sheets are breathable, comfortable, will give you the right amount of cooling, & are like a silk to touch. These bed sheets are woven expertly from the finest long staple yarns to produce bedsheets that are light weight in nature & long lasting PACKAGING INCLUDES: King Set includes a 78 x 80 x 15 inch fitted Sheet. Comes in many attractive colors to suit your bedroom décor. Fully elasticized fitted Sheets with 15 inch deep pockets are generously sized to fit deep and pillow-top mattress. These 400 Thread Count sheets will upgrade your living space & area. EXPERIENCE Confort AT YOUR HOME: These cotton fitted sheets work for any room in your house. It could be your bedroom, guest bed, kids room, a comfortable sheets is always welcomed. Not only this, these sheets are perfect for hotel bedding too. Whatever is the occasion, these deep pocket king fitted sheets will be a great choice & can also be used as travel sheets wherever you go. If you are looking for a next-level comfort in sleep & style, then these percale sheets are your right choice. EASY TO CARE & MAINTAIN: These durable quality fitted sheets will never slip off from your mattress. These sheets can be easily machine washed. Always choose a regular cycle and never put a fabric softener or bleach in the machine. Tumble dry on low. The more you wash these sheets, the fresh they will become. A GREAT GIFTING ITEM: These fitted sheets are a great gifting item to friends & family on various occasions. These can be gifted on birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, house warming party & many such occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519FeIaHTOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atelier","source_asin":"B0C6FJWJW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6FJWJW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6FJWJW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
