window.products.push({"id":232555,"name":"Small Wood Finials, 2-7/8 inch Wooden Finials for Crafting, DIY Décor, and Wooden Finial Crafts, Pack of 12, by Woodpeckers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MW26sdUhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"BECAUSE WE CARE ABOUT QUALITY…Our small wood finials are carefully turned out of one solid piece of birch hardwood. They have an attractive wood grain and beautiful carved details, and are a unique and hard-to-find wood accent piece for those looking to make a statement. These small wood finials will look sharp wherever you put them! FINIALS, JUST SMALLER AND BETTER-Small wooden finials have all the goodness of wood finials, just in Small! These decorative ornaments will look fantastic as scroll ends for paper scrolls and DIY invitations , or as part of a tassel. Building a birdhouse, dollhouse, or creating miniatures? Add detail and elegance to your project with our one-of-a-kind finials. Add a dowel cap head, and you've got an adorable peg doll! LOOKS LIKE IT WAS MADE FOR YOUR PROJECT-The perfect finishing touch has got to match the rest of the project, don't you think? We left our wood finials unfinished so you can choose the look. The finials take paint or stain well, so you can easily match them to your project. KNOW THE SIZE YOU NEED-Let's get to know all the (super-important!) specs you gotta know when using your wood finials for crafts! This gorgeous finial has a height of 2-7/8\" including the tenon, which has a length of 5/8\". The tenon diameter is 3/8\", the base diameter is 3/4\" and it has a diameter of 7/8\" at its widest point. WOOD PARTS BY CRAFTERS, FOR CRAFTERS - At Woodpeckers, crafting and building with wood is our thing. Bringing you more of the wood craft supplies you love is our fun. And seeing pics and vids of your creative creations - that's our after-we-finish-today's-work treat! Have questions about your product? Please do get in touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MW26sdUhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woodpeckers","source_asin":"B082MSX7KF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MSX7KF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MSX7KF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
