window.products.push({"id":232579,"name":"Foodycubes Silicone Freezer Organizer for Food Storage, Ice Cube Tray, Soup Tray With Airtight Lid, Makes 6 x 1/2 cup measured portions with latched l","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LAKHJTXaL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"★ HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: The BPA free food storage containers are made from 100% food grade platinum cured silicone. The freezer food storage organizer has a latched airtight lid that prevents leaks and spillages so you know the food will keep its freshness and the food won’t spoil. <br> ★ MULTIFUNCTIONAL: Meal Prep and freeze perfect portions of food in the same silicone food storage container. Whether it’s fridge or freezer storage, easily store all leftovers including sauces, broths, soups, stock, stews and dips. The airtight lid locks in freshness when storing in the fridge or freezer. Open the steam release valve to provide even reheating in the microwave. FOODYCUBES ARE NOT DESIGNED FOR OVEN USE. THEY ARE DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR FRIDGE AND FREEZER USE ONLY. <br> ★ REUSABLE: Environmentally friendly cold and hot food storage option. It’s made from extremely durable material and can be used over and over in the freezer microwave and dishwasher. The food portions are easy to pop out as food won’t stick to the bottom. Perfect baby food storage container and airtight pet food storage containers. <br> ★ PREVENTS WASTAGE: The Foodycubes freezer food storage container is perfect for meal prep, freezing and storing smaller portions. Minimize your food wastage and save on freezer bags. With 2 sizes available, you can choose between 6 x ½ cup portions or 4 x 1 cup portions. Ideal for portion control for kids when packing their snacks or helping with weight management. <br> ★ GET ORGANIZED: Color coded in Red or Green for stress-free food freezer organization. Preparing, freezing and storing foods is so easy and convenient with our freezer friendly food trays. Measure out perfect portions for snacks, lunches and dinners every time with easy-to-use ½ cup, ¼ cup, 125ml and 50ml measuring lines.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LAKHJTXaL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foodycubes","source_asin":"B08ZYKYZD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYKYZD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYKYZD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
