window.products.push({"id":232591,"name":"Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer and Dispenser for Kitchen Drawer, 4 Separate Openable Top Cover Food Storage Bag Holders Suitable for Ziplock, Solimo, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWs4Nl-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Eco-friendly & Practical】This ziplock bag storage organizer is made of durable and sturdy eco-friendly plastic material, which is safe and non-toxic, lighter and more flexible than heavy wood; our ziplock bag organizer come with exquisite appearance and elegant color, which can not only store messy food bags, also perfect to decorate your kitchen. ✅【Laser Engraving】 Each ziplock bag organizer is laser engraved with labels of gallons, snacks, sandwiches and quart ziplock bags, making it easier to identify and take out the ziplock bags, just say goodbye to messy drawers and keep your food bags organized. ✅【Easy to Use】These 4 separate kitchen drawer food bag storage box, no tools and assembly needed; the snap-on top cover can be easily opened or firmly closed, which is convenient for storing a bulk of ziplock bags, and also don't worry about the lid falling off when pulling out the bags. ✅【Suitable for Most Brands】Carry360 ziplock bag orgnizer is composed of three small boxes (8.8L*3.5W*2.5H inches) and one large box (11.8L*4W*2.5H inches), different sizes of the food storage bag holder with amazing capacity, makes it can perfectly store most brands of Ziplock, Solimo, Hefty, Glad & GreatValue storage bags, But not compatible with big size slider bags. ✅【Multifunctional Storage】This zip lock bag container organizer is designed with a wide mouth, which can not only store ziplock bags, but also store tableware such as knives, spoons, forks, etc.; provides you with different storage methods, you can easily put it on the kitchen counter, drawer, cabinet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWs4Nl-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carry360","source_asin":"B09NKYF77W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NKYF77W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NKYF77W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
