window.products.push({"id":232665,"name":"Kitchen Mama Silicone Basting Pastry Brush: Set of 2 Heat Resistant Basting Brushes for Baking, Grilling, Cooking and Spreading Oil, Butter, BBQ Sauce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzjlp34HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium & Heat-Resistant Silicone】Prepare the perfect sauce or glaze with this Silicone Pastry Basting Brush Set, featuring a unique silicone design that is heat resistant and durable enough for use with any recipe. The sturdy handle and flexible silicone bristles can be used to apply marinades and sauces on uneven edges and corners. This pastry brush won't melt, shrink or smell while grilling, cooking, or baking. BPA-free and 101% safe to use. 【Dishwasher Safe & Easy Maintaining】The Silicone Basting brushes do not retain odors or grease so it stays clean every time you use them. Each brush has a hanging eyelet for easy storage and easy drying. They can be cleaned thoroughly by hand or placed safely in your dishwasher for easy cleanup. With proper care, the silicone pastry brush set will certainly last for a long time. Totally a money-saving solution! 【Two Sizes To Meet Your Needs】This brush set contains two different-sized brushes. The large brush can do it all: baste meats, glaze pastries, and get into corners of a casserole dish. Its long handle is perfect for BBQ grilling, keeping your hands safe from the heat. The small brush is perfect for spreading melted butter, oil, mustard, sauce, egg wash, or glazes for cooking and baking. Get this set of 3 basting brushes to fulfill all your cooking and baking needs. 【Ergonomic One-Piece Design】The one-piece seamless design means you’ll not get annoyed by the brush head falling off or loosening up while spreading. The durable silicone bristles will not break or shed on your food. The handle provides a comfortable, firm grip making basting easy. No bacteria, no stains. Just a delightful cooking, baking, or grilling experience. 【Perfect For Basting and Pasting】The large brush has 5 rows of 17 bristles while the small brush has 4 rows of 14 bristles. They are designed to hold a good amount of basting liquids and sauces for increased flavor and moisture. The high tensile strength allows you to baste and spread liquids evenly. The soft and flexible silicone bristles are suitable for delicately pasting rolls/cakes without dragging the dough or scratching the pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzjlp34HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Mama","source_asin":"B09TXPHSKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TXPHSKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TXPHSKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
