window.products.push({"id":232794,"name":"OKD Farmhouse TV Stand for 75 Inch TV, Industrial & Farmhouse Media Entertainment Center w/Sliding Barn Door, Rustic TV Console Cabinet w/Adjustable S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pMGNVG8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHIC INDUSTRIAL& FARMHOUSE STYLE:Product Measured: 66\" W × 15.75\" D × 28\"H , Fits for flat curved screen TVs up to 75''. It features a perfect blend of industrial and modern farmhouse.The antique white finish delivers a naturally aged feel and creates a cozy and retro vibe. Enhancing its charm: sliding barn doors with inset metal mesh and dark iron-tone hardware.This new OKD media console can fit well in any space in your home and matches perfectly with other OKD farmhouse furniture. ROOMY AND MULTIFUNCTIONAL:Each cabinet has one shelve adjustable with 3 heights to fit for items with different sizes,providing customizable organization for media, electronics, accessories, books, or decor. Three pre-punched large cutouts help to keep wires free of clutter.Sliding barn doors on the TV stand for convenient access to cabinets while space saving. You can also choose to slide the door to any side of the TV console for a clean, organized look. It can work as a TV stand in your living room, a storage cabinet in your bedroom, or a buffet in your kitchen or dining room cabinet in the bedroom. BUILT TO LAST:Constructed with premium engineered wood and metal,featureing a durable laminate finish and well structured design.This OKD entertainment center is built to withstand the challenges of long-term use.4 wood support legs plus two extra support legs under bottom shelf makes this tv console table quite stable and durable and increases the weight capacity a lot. The thickened tabletop (1.18'') can easily hold up to 150 lbs, bottom shelves can holds up to 50 lbs and 3 adjustable shelves support up to 30 lbs each. EASY ASSEMBLY: All parts, hardware kits, and clear instructions for the OKD TV credenza are in one package.Each screw and pin has its own code and boards are clearly labeled to let you easily understand the assembly progress.It requires 1-2 adult people to complete the assembly in about 60 mins. PACKAGE AND SERVICE:This TV stand will be shipped directly from our US LOCAL WAREHOUSE. It is packaged with secure box that contains foam and protective boards surrounding to prevent damages. In case any problem or you are not satisfied, please contact us without hesitation,we always reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pMGNVG8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKD","source_asin":"B0BBNCYQGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-232794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBNCYQGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBNCYQGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
